  id: D_MindForgets
  shots:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Before the world shattered into myth and magic, human ambition sought to chain the planet's lifeblood. In the deep dark where truth was buried, two investigators dared to unearth it.
    captionSpeaker: 
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "Arthur! The institute triggered a scorched-earth purge\u2014the resonance cascade is already ripping through the upper bedrock! If we don't dump the reserve charge right now, the containment rupture will vaporize the entire continental plate!"
    captionSpeaker: Elise
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: The displacement field can only shelter one biological pattern. My nervous system can't take the feedback, but your vitals are stable. I'm locking the capsule from out here... You have to wake up, Arthur. Even if everything burns... live.
    captionSpeaker: Elise
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: 'The mind forgets what it cannot bear to hold.

      Yet beneath the dust of thousands of years... the soul remembers.'
    captionSpeaker: 
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: '>> CORE RE-INITIALIZATION: OK

      >> TEMPORAL DRIFT ESTIMATE: [CORRUPTED / OVERFLOW]

      >> MEMORY SECTORS 01-89: UNREADABLE (DATA PURGED)

      >> PRIMARY OPTICAL TRANSLATOR: ONLINE

      >> UNIT DESIGNATION: FORENSIC & ANALYTICAL ASSISTANCE CONSTRUCT

      >> CURRENT PROTOCOL: INVESTIGATE / SURVIVE'
    captionSpeaker: System
